"""Vision-first in-browser browser-task loop.

The model looks at the current Chrome viewport, chooses one generic browser action, and
the runtime executes, verifies, records receipts, enforces cancellation and backend-owned
final-action authorization, then re-observes. There is no structured/deterministic agent loop
in this module.
"""

